"<p>The file <strong>%1</strong> does not exist or is not readable, aborting."
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>Datoteka <filename>%1</filename> ne postoji ili nije čitljiv, "
"obustavljam.</p></qt>"

#: insertfile/insertfileplugin.cpp:148
#, kde-format
